# Cultivate searches its controller's library for up to two basic land cards, reveals them, puts ONE onto the battlefield
# tapped and the OTHER into the hand (CR 701.23a, 701.20, 400.7, 608.2). The library holds three basics and a nonbasic land:
# the search refuses Tropical Island (not basic) and three basics at once (the most is two), then takes an Island and a Plains,
# revealing both. The Island is chosen for the battlefield, so it arrives tapped, and the Plains - not the Island - is the one
# in the hand; if the two steps were swapped the hand would hold the Island. The library is shuffled (CR 701.24), so the order
# it would have kept is gone. Bot2's seven Islands stay in its hand and its library (CR 701.23b).

